  "howToPlayTitle": "How to play",
  "howToPlayBody": "Goal\nFind who the Spy is before they figure out the secret word. The Spy must blend in and deduce the word from everyone else's hints.\n\nBefore you start\n• From Home, pick a category.\n• On the players screen, add at least three players, edit names if you like, then tap Start.\n• The app picks one random Spy and a secret word from that category. Everyone except the Spy sees the word.\n\nPass the phone carefully\nOnly the active player should look at the screen. Do not peek when it is someone else's turn.\n\nWhat happens in a round\n1) Roles — each player learns whether they are the Spy or an insider, and sees the word only if they are not the Spy.\n2) Questions — players take turns asking and answering about the secret. Ask in a way that helps your team but does not hand the exact word to the Spy.\n3) Voting — each player votes for who they think is the Spy.\n4) Reveal & finish — the Spy is revealed, then you try to pick the secret word from several choices.\n\nScores (on the results screen)\n• During voting, if you voted for the real Spy, your tally goes up by one.\n• If the final word guess is correct, the Spy's tally goes up by one.\n\nTip\nIf you are not the Spy, watch who avoids specifics or changes the subject — but innocent players can sound suspicious too!",
